1) 从告警标签取 virtual_address/virtual_port 与:
1) Take virtual_address/virtual_port and address/port from the alert labels and run ipvsadm -Ln to check whether this real server's weight is 0;
2) If the weight is 0, check the keepalived or health-check daemon logs to see why it judged the backend unhealthy;
3) Probe the backend's service port directly from the director with curl or telnet to confirm the process and port are alive;
4) If the backend really is healthy, check the network from director to backend and the LVS forwarding mode configuration (DR mode requires the VIP and arp_ignore to be configured correctly on the backend).
